    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning when you choose this archetype at 3rd level, you can evoke arcane energy in your attacks. When you take the Attack action, you may choose to deliver your ranged weapon attacks against your marked creature as Arcane Shots. Until the end of your turn, your ranged attacks against your marked target gains the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your attacks ignores half and three-quarters cover.</p></li><li><p>On each hit, the weapon deals additional force damage to the target equal to 2 + half your hunter level.</p></li></ul><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier. You regain all spent uses after finishing a short or long rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
